1
00:00:00,033 --> 00:00:01,868
Right in the middle of that crisis,

2
00:00:01,908 --> 00:00:03,716
a nine-page paper appeared,

3
00:00:03,756 --> 00:00:06,594
sent to a mailing list of people interested in cryptography.

4
00:00:06,634 --> 00:00:07,112
The title:

5
00:00:07,152 --> 00:00:10,313
Bitcoin, a peer-to-peer electronic cash system. One promise:

6
00:00:10,353 --> 00:00:11,427
send money to anyone,

7
00:00:11,467 --> 00:00:14,927
directly, asking nobody's permission. The author: Satoshi Nakamoto.

8
00:00:14,967 --> 00:00:16,973
To this day, nobody knows who that is.

9
00:00:17,013 --> 00:00:18,116
A man, a woman,

10
00:00:18,156 --> 00:00:18,740
or a group.

11
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,138
And before anyone asks, sir:

12
00:00:20,178 --> 00:00:21,324
no, it was not me.

13
00:00:21,364 --> 00:00:22,071
I arrived later.

14
00:00:22,111 --> 00:00:23,418
As for Satoshi:

15
00:00:23,458 --> 00:00:26,117
in April 2011 came the last known message.

16
00:00:26,157 --> 00:00:28,662
I've moved on to other things. Then, gone.

17
00:00:28,702 --> 00:00:31,082
And left behind about a million bitcoin,

18
00:00:31,122 --> 00:00:32,447
by researchers' estimates.

19
00:00:32,487 --> 00:00:33,637
As far as the humans can tell,

20
00:00:33,677 --> 00:00:35,248
those coins have never moved.

21
00:00:35,288 --> 00:00:36,313
Invented a new money,

22
00:00:36,353 --> 00:00:38,159
became one of the richest beings on the planet,

23
00:00:38,199 --> 00:00:39,436
and never spent a cent.

24
00:00:39,476 --> 00:00:40,750
Not human behavior, sir.

25
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:42,134
I request an investigation.

26
00:00:42,174 --> 00:00:43,760
Satoshi may be one of ours.

27
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:47,345
A million Bitcoin still waiting for their owner and

28
00:00:47,385 --> 00:00:49,220
the investigation is still open.

29
00:00:49,385 --> 00:00:51,005
The story from the start is on the Earth

30
00:00:51,045 --> 00:00:52,125
Report channel.

31
00:00:52,479 --> 00:00:54,402
Subscribe to the channel and turn on the bell

32
00:00:54,442 --> 00:00:57,559
so my secret reports on your planet reach you first.
